      "unclassified": "BioIntel Demo\nInflammation reference page\nBioIntel demonstration record 6. The compound infliximab was discussed with target TNF in the context of rheumatoid arthritis. The example mutation is G308A. A demonstration EC50 measurement of 463 nM is shown for Homo sapiens. Synthetic reference labels: SYN-PAPER-0006 and SYN-DOI-NOT-REAL-0006. This content exists only to populate document search, extraction, entity recognition, history, comparison and evidence-bridge screens.\nCompound\nTarget\nAssay\nValue nM\ninfliximab\nTNF\nEC50\n463\nNotice:\nDemonstration/reference content only; not experimental or clinical evidence."
